<title>SPAIN: Fenosa wins 2 bln pta European contracts.</title>
<headline>Fenosa wins 2 bln pta European contracts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Union Fenosa said on Wednesday its international unit has won contracts in central Europe worth two billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Fenosa's fully-owned affiliate Fenosa ACEX won five contracts from gas distributors in the Czech Republic for a total of one billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Fenosa ACEX also won another two contracts to improve electricity distribution in northern Moravia and western Slovakia, for one billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
